      "uid": "zhcn:95fe5d0f628eff7d5ef65ddd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然要到国外挑战不熟悉的环境，\n那就该好好了解当地状况，\n以充满野心的挑战者姿态去适应当地环境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0386aa28a3e665cb97a9035b024f40676a6fe2656debccf8d412248ebffa835c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
